      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 736,
        "height": 672,
        "content": "## Expense Validation & Quality Checks\nThis section validates extracted OCR data before AI enrichment begins. It checks whether critical expense information such as merchant name and amount exists. Invalid receipts are automatically flagged and routed to Slack alerts for manual review and troubleshooting."
