        "color": 7,
        "width": 1232,
        "height": 672,
        "content": "## AI Expense Intelligence & Categorization\n\nThis section uses AI to enrich expense data with intelligent classifications. The model determines whether the expense is business or personal, assigns a refined category, predicts expense type, and calculates confidence scores to improve downstream analytics and reporting accuracy."
      },
