      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1824,
        "height": 976,
        "content": "## Automated Expense Analytics Dashboard\n\nThis scheduled analytics pipeline generates business intelligence reports from stored expense data. It calculates monthly spend trends, category distributions, top merchants, and business-vs-personal spending summaries, then sends dashboard insights automatically to Slack for monitoring."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "aa1e4cbb-750b-4408-b69f-63da940e642a",
      "name": "Sticky Note8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1472,
        -48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 768,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## Workflow Architecture & Setup Instructions\n\nThis workflow automates end-to-end expense management using OCR, AI classification, PostgreSQL storage, Google Drive archiving, Slack alerts, and analytics reporting. Users upload receipts through a form, after which Mindee OCR extracts receipt data and AI enriches expense categories and classifications. The workflow validates extracted data, prevents duplicates, uploads receipt files to Google Drive, and stores structured expense records in PostgreSQL.\n\nTo set up the workflow, configure the following integrations:\n\n**1.** Mindee OCR API credentials\n**2.** OpenAI API credentials\n**3.** PostgreSQL database connection\n**4.** Google Drive OAuth connection\n**5.** Slack API integration\n**6.** Create PostgreSQL `expenses` table\n**7.** Configure Google Drive upload folder\n**8.** Activate schedule trigger for analytics reporting\n\nOnce activated, the workflow becomes a fully automated smart expense tracking system capable of receipt processing, AI categorization, duplicate prevention, document storage, and dashboard analytics generation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
